{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "96d89da9-cd49-44d5-8818-ef4908c85e9a",
    "name": "Ask, Don't Assume \u2014 Backend",
    "description": "REST tests and demo for the Ask, Don't Assume backend (OCBC Ignite, PS4).\n\n1. Start the backend and run `node seed.js`.\n2. Set `baseUrl` (default http://localhost:3000).\n3. Run the whole collection with the Runner, or send requests one by one in folder order.\n\nSocket.IO messages (event, handoff:*) can't be saved in a collection file; see postman-guide.md.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Dashboard",
      "description": "What the console's Insights tab calls. Run after `node seed.js` to see the synthetic data.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Friction per page",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/insights/friction",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "insights",
                "friction"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Counts friction events per page and type. Totals only, never individual sessions."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const rows = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Returns an array of { _id: { page, type }, count }\", () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(rows).to.be.an(\"array\");",
                  "  rows.forEach(r => { pm.expect(r._id).to.have.keys(\"page\", \"type\"); pm.expect(r._id.type).to.match(/^friction:/); });",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Has data (run node seed.js if this fails)\", () => pm.expect(rows.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "const top = rows.slice().sort((a, b) => b.count - a.count)[0];",
                  "if (top) console.log(\"Most friction:\", top._id.page, top._id.type, top.count);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Eligibility",
      "description": "Step 1 of the journey. Nothing is stored: passport country and age are only checked.",
      "item": [
